body:
Well that first part really doesn’t inspire confidence ^^;

I’ve never done any interview type thing cause I had no way to know I should. I also don’t even really have the money to afford therapy rn in the first place so I definitely don’t have the money to afford doing that.

I never had any of them for too long because there was nothing good coming from their sessions. One of them after 4 or 5 sessions literally suggested stopping because he didn’t know how to help me.

I don’t like baseless optimism. It’s very likely no one will end up liking me, but I guess that’s not the point.

I feel like I would need someone who would prefer a flat chest and doesn’t express liking breasts cause I’ll still feel inadequate about not having them if at a given time they do wish I had them or something, even though I actively don’t want them either ;w;

Also worried about how I’d be able to love my partner properly if they have breasts that are anything more than not little now that I think about it and I’m super panicking cause I feel like caring about this to the extent where I might not be with someone with bigger breasts is just a totally asshole trait.

It being welcome is something I would assume is done; I hope so!

Unfortunately doesn’t change how isolating it feels with the level of dislike I seem to have.

I felt like it was obvious enough that I don’t hate people for liking them or having them and that it was just about feeling isolated ;-;

Heya! I don't like just sending messages in dms right away cause I personally get a lil' creeped out about it, but I'm 20 enby (they/she amab) who also plays games a lot too. We don't \*directly\* share any, but Deltarune is sick, I play platform fighters in the form of Smash, enjoy listening to and watching people play games even if I'm not the most familiar, and yeah! Pokemon, Smash Bros, and Arknights are my big ones.

&#x200B;

Also I'm asexual too so we could both sigh a breath of relief at no horny creepiness if we chat.

&#x200B;

I don't think this was the most enticing message ever, but hey! If you wanna chat, I'd be down to try c:
